DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T150000
UID:cffcd5bca17eedbde1a01ba5b0db0f0a@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Welcome trainers\, to Pokémon Club! Pokémon club meets every
  Wednesday to share in the love of Pokémon. Come participate in activitie
 s and learn to play the trading card game\, and even take down powerful Po
 kémon in Raids! Materials are provided. Participants may bring their own 
 deck\, but we recommend you leave your most precious cards at home.
LOCATION:*Children's Activity Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/16086887
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
